I know. I just don't find her physically attractive.

00:21:06.020 --> 00:21:10.390
Memories, they have a habit of sticking to you like.

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:13.960
Like a tube on a pipe?

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:19.280
Yeah, something like that.

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:23.040
Come on, let's get out of here.

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:24.780
I'll buy you a drink down the drain.

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:27.620
Can I take a rain check on that?

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:29.410
My guts are playing up.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:32.780
Sure. Here's a pound if you change your mind.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:37.310
Thanks. Are you sure you're gonna be

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:40.700
alright? Can I take a rain check on

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:48.990
that? You bet. Satch? Yeah.

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:52.060
If you pass a postbox, can you pop this in?

00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:54.270
It's my Paul's coupon. Sure thing.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:04.260
I'd been pound foolish. I could see that now. And that takes humility.

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:09.880
Nothing could take the place of my son. Not even a pet.

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:12.360
Though I would like a Jack Russell. They're very clever dogs.

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:17.260
I thought back to the good times we had together. We'd play games all the time.

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:19.840
I'd beat him easily, of course, but that wasn't the point.

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:22.830
He learned something important from each fresh defeat.

00:22:25.300 --> 00:22:27.180
The one thing he could do was outjump me.

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:29.980
That, one day, would prove to be his...

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:36.290
undoing but i'd need a scotch before i told you about that one all i'm saying is it involved a hop

00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:37.670
and the blades of a helicopter

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:04.930
The pube on the pipe metaphor came from a real-life incident,

00:23:04.950 --> 00:23:07.230
which I observed in the gents at Dean's.

00:23:07.330 --> 00:23:11.050
All I know is the pube weren't mine,

00:23:11.920 --> 00:23:14.770
cos mine are grey, or indeed white,

00:23:15.420 --> 00:23:17.720
so I can't take credit for that one.

00:23:19.340 --> 00:23:21.770
In the end, I picked up that pube, and I'm glad I did,

00:23:21.890 --> 00:23:23.930
because it made that gents a better place to be in.

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:26.310
And that is my question to the government.

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:28.830
Are you prepared to get your hands dirty,

00:23:29.030 --> 00:23:29.970
or are you going to let...

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:31.400
things clog up the system.

00:24:02.876 --> 00:24:05.876
Garth Marenghi's Dark Place is a Garth Marenghi production.

00:24:06.364 --> 00:24:07.364
in association with Dean Lerner.
